{"title": "Animate Dead (Duergar)", "pageid": 40454, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Animate_Dead_(Duergar)", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Animate_Dead_Duergar.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Animate_Dead_Duergar.webp/300px-Animate_Dead_Duergar.webp, /w/images/0/08/Animate_Dead_Duergar.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Animate_Dead_Duergar.webp/300px-Animate_Dead_Duergar.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Animate_Dead_Duergar.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Animate Dead</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 necromancy spell</a>. Gekh Coal uses this spell to animate a pile of corpses at the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark#Beach\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark Beach</a>. It cannot be learned by party members.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Animate a pile of bones or a corpse to serve you. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\